  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 5th level the symbiotic bond between the daevic and the daeva that possesses him protects him from outside influences. The daevic gains a +1 bonus to all saves vs. enchantment spells and effects. This bonus increases by an additional +1 at 8th level and every 3 levels thereafter.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/daevic#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
